  "body": "Naruto modpack designed for use on the Naruto Storm Online server.\n\n**Naruto Storm Online** is the ultimate Naruto-themed server where you'll experience a **unique mod**, a **party system** for **boss battles**, **village creation**, **tailed beast collecting**, and more. Join forces with fellow players to face challenging bosses, create and lead your village, and **collect all 9 tailed beasts to unlock the legendary Juubi**. Get ready for an immersive Naruto adventure like no other – join us now and become a part of the ninja world in Naruto Storm Online!\n\n![Logo NSO](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9f16495d4106742b2d51a817951135fe8931cb09.png)",
